# Complete semantic translation of the historical standalone usb_ah.wlcmd.
#
# The five historical STREAMS and timeout entry points are automatic roots
# because their addresses escape through qinit structures or qtimeout().
# The historical bus_ops mappings to warlock_dummy cannot affect usb_ah,
# which has no bus_ops vector or call site.
#
# The removal-era source placed putnext directly in qinit even though the
# historical policy named usb_ah_wput.  The current source's usb_ah_wput
# wrapper was added to remove that incompatible function-pointer cast and now
# supplies the intended write-side entry point.  No explicit locklint
# declarations are required.
